{"c":[{"id":"d8373d741af56a81","sum":"Caret skills: name/description JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/ (not Apify SKILL.md). Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 has its own Developer ID and AX prompt; Caret's grant does not stop it. Debug menu shows truncated last-2 via history-debug; inference last-N hard-fails.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"25648c3d0b258189","sum":"Caret skills are name/description JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/, not Apify's coding-agent SKILL.md; Apify is not a selected executor. Niko QA/Preflight (2026-09-19) used only cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh-fast or Gemini 3.8 Flash.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T185053Z-ae95c44f0be90de0","text":"Apify Agent Skills are coding-agent SKILL.md (MCP/CLI/Actors); Caret skills are name/description JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/. Apify is not a selected Caret executor.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T185221Z-b9280ccda04db89b","text":"2026-09-19: Niko QA/Preflight in this repo today must use only cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh-fast or Gemini 3.8 Flash (Gemini not on the subagent allow-list).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"458043431cd4683f","sum":"Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 has its own Developer ID (screenpipe) and its own AX prompt; granting Caret Accessibility does not stop it. Caret Debug menu shows truncated last-2 windows/minutes/clipboard via history-debug CLI; last-N hard-fail stays for inference.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T190218Z-3dcac55ddd67aa19","text":"Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 is Developer ID identifier screenpipe, not Caret; it calls AXIsProcessTrustedWithOptions and retries while waiting. Granting Caret Accessibility does not stop its dialog.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T190435Z-bd82100fe9b9695e","text":"Caret Debug menu shows truncated last-2 windows/minutes/clipboard via history-debug CLI; last-N hard-fail stays for inference.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1dc8d7a171a0b9ab","sum":"Caret runs screenpipe@0.4.50 as launchd job dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe on :3031 via the cli-darwin Mach-O (TCC is that binary); its screen/AX preflights stayed false despite Settings. Caret.xcodeproj object IDs must be unique; a FileRef in a Sources list breaks xcodebuild.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"73ecfa7fb5d9e38e","sum":"Caret runs screenpipe@0.4.50 as launchd job dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe on :3031, exec'ing the cli-darwin Mach-O (TCC is that binary), not the npx shim; it logged screen=false accessibility=false and System Settings ON did not flip those preflights.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T190651Z-7c7ff0f30e9d0baa","text":"Caret-spawned screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 at 14:03 logged screen=false accessibility=false and retried VisionManager every 5s; System Settings ON did not flip those preflights.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T191856Z-e383776735c95605","text":"Caret starts screenpipe@0.4.50 as launchd job dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe on :3031; exec the cli-darwin Mach-O, not npx/node shim. TCC is that binary.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"23edfb00e1d611eb","sum":"After PR #11 (main merged), README/productContext/techContext keep launchd Screenpipe wording and the Debug last-2 preview. Caret.xcodeproj object IDs must be unique; a FileRef in a Sources files list stops xcodebuild opening the project.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T192245Z-7c3e6304f151c521","text":"PR #11 merged main; README/productContext/techContext keep launchd Screenpipe wording plus Debug last-2 preview.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T192513Z-736b08c59f95f4f1","text":"Caret.xcodeproj object IDs must be unique; a FileRef in a Sources files list makes xcodebuild unable to open the project","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
